### Necessário para pegar o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:41000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "qwe",
  "password": "qwe"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### registrar entrada (horaentrada vazia = agora)
POST http://localhost:41000/insertRegistro HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "veiculoid": 1
}

### buscar todos os registros
GET http://localhost:41000/getAllRegistros HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### buscar registro por ID
GET http://localhost:41000/getRegistroByID/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### atualizar registro
PUT http://localhost:41000/updateRegistro/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "veiculoid": 1,
  "horaentrada": "2026-10-20T10:00:00-03:00",
  "horasaida": "2026-10-20T12:30:00-03:00",
  "valor": 24.00
}

### registrar saída agora (calcula o valor)
PUT http://localhost:41000/registrarSaida/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### remover registro (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:41000/deleteRegistro/1 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}